# Mutation plan for a `~channel` mention on `POST /api/v4/posts` — FillInPostProps, the
# per-viewer rewrite on a read, and the `channel_mentions` broadcast hook.
#
#   scripts/mutate-batch.sh scripts/mutations/post-create-channel-mentions.plan
#
# Tab-separated: name<TAB>file<TAB>from<TAB>to<TAB>suite<TAB>filter.  `\n` becomes a newline.
#
# Not mutated because the stack cannot see them: the team-lookup failure arm in FillInPostProps
# (every mentioned channel's team exists), the hook suite's channel-lookup failure arm (every
# id on a frame is a live channel), and the raiser's pre-strip of the prop from the shared frame
# (the hook rewrites every recipient's copy, so the strip only shows when the hook itself fails). The last two lines are the no-op controls and must SURVIVE.

